{{/*
  Targets to delete on apply. chezmoi does not remove a file just because it
  left the source tree — it stops managing it — so a script that is being
  retired needs naming here to actually leave the machines it reached.

  bin/regenerate-completions wrote _just and _chezmoi into brew's
  site-functions. Every completion there is a symlink brew maintains into the
  Cellar, so running it downgraded a self-updating completion to a static file
  frozen at whatever version generated it. Nothing replaces it; there is
  nothing to generate.

  Safe to delete this file once both machines have applied once.
*/ -}}
bin/regenerate-completions
